WEBVTT

01:03.670 --> 01:04.670
Three on the left.

01:06.430 --> 01:07.290
One at the back.

01:19.039 --> 01:19.970
Two at the front.

01:24.870 --> 01:26.670
Four on the left. Six at the back.

01:31.600 --> 01:33.460
Five at the back. One at the front.

02:25.320 --> 02:26.400
Kill him.

02:26.970 --> 02:28.020
Kill him!

02:29.110 --> 02:30.140
Kill him!

02:30.950 --> 02:32.340
Kill him!

02:32.910 --> 02:33.810
Are you crazy?

02:34.410 --> 02:35.350
Are you crazy?

02:41.640 --> 02:42.510
Shrimpie!

04:17.769 --> 04:24.230
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

04:24.610 --> 04:27.100
[Episode 19]

04:51.060 --> 04:51.860
Maniacs!

04:52.720 --> 04:54.220
Both of them are crazy.

04:58.750 --> 04:59.960
Which way did they go?

05:00.820 --> 05:02.030
Which way did they go?

05:03.160 --> 05:03.870
They...

05:05.100 --> 05:06.040
I heard...

05:07.240 --> 05:08.700
they ran outside.

05:11.980 --> 05:13.580
Everyone who can still move,

05:14.270 --> 05:15.930
come with me to chase them now!

05:58.920 --> 05:59.830
I heard...

06:00.690 --> 06:02.190
they ran outside.

06:06.410 --> 06:07.280
It's a trap.

06:39.810 --> 06:41.340
Let's take a breather here.

06:41.370 --> 06:43.030
They won't catch up that fast.

06:47.720 --> 06:49.050
Are you out of your mind?

06:49.510 --> 06:51.100
What were you doing, Zhang Haixia?

06:51.100 --> 06:53.100
You've never been like that before.

06:54.930 --> 06:56.730
Was it because of that medicine?

07:06.050 --> 07:07.650
What was so strange about it?

07:11.710 --> 07:12.710
Your expression.

07:19.530 --> 07:20.990
What about my expression?

07:22.490 --> 07:24.690
An expression you had never had before.

07:30.630 --> 07:32.490
I'd like to know what you're up to.

07:33.060 --> 07:33.740
What?

07:34.300 --> 07:35.690
You went to the Archives,

07:35.690 --> 07:36.890
became a member of the Zhang family,

07:36.890 --> 07:39.020
and now you think you know everything?

07:39.750 --> 07:40.510
Don't be ridiculous.

07:40.510 --> 07:41.310
Zhang Haixia!

07:42.330 --> 07:43.570
Who possessed you?

07:47.810 --> 07:49.270
Are you even Zhang Haixia?

07:51.170 --> 07:52.430
What's wrong with you?

07:53.000 --> 07:54.530
Of course I am Zhang Haixia.

07:54.860 --> 07:56.190
And I'm perfectly fine.

07:58.760 --> 08:00.560
I feel better than ever.

08:02.590 --> 08:04.790
Then what about the injury on your hand?

08:04.860 --> 08:05.990
You're so annoying.

08:10.980 --> 08:12.640
I had planned everything out.

08:13.190 --> 08:14.390
I wasn't going to die.

08:15.420 --> 08:17.180
And even if that person had died,

08:17.180 --> 08:19.980
Zhang Qishan would definitely
make the next move.

08:20.050 --> 08:22.180
Isn't this the way you liked it before?

08:22.560 --> 08:24.160
Did I restrict you too much

08:24.770 --> 08:26.370
and make you so overcautious

08:27.250 --> 08:28.140
that even such a small matter

08:28.140 --> 08:29.390
made you so nervous?

08:43.770 --> 08:44.340
Fine.

08:45.500 --> 08:46.250
I got it.

08:46.910 --> 08:47.720
But for future operations,

08:47.720 --> 08:49.320
we must stay together, okay?

09:16.000 --> 09:16.780
Don't move!

09:24.210 --> 09:24.930
Over there!

09:31.260 --> 09:32.520
He's there! After him!

09:41.410 --> 09:43.140
Did you see a man with a cripple?

09:45.530 --> 09:46.460
Where were they?

09:53.210 --> 09:53.740
Let's go!

09:58.500 --> 09:59.320
Sir,

09:59.700 --> 10:00.960
there are a lot of bugs here.

10:00.960 --> 10:02.560
Would you like to sit inside?

10:28.430 --> 10:31.870
[Ninth Master Xie,
the Ninth Clan of the Old Nine Clans]

10:39.630 --> 10:41.030
Do you know how to play Go?

10:42.940 --> 10:43.670
A little bit.

11:13.470 --> 11:14.930
You call this a little bit?

11:23.990 --> 11:26.540
[Shun's Grocery Store]

11:51.360 --> 11:53.960
[Heibei the Sixth,
the Sixth Clan of the Old Nine Clans]

12:31.220 --> 12:33.580
Are all you Changxiang people
so hot-tempered?

12:33.580 --> 12:35.030
It's from eating spicy food?

12:35.030 --> 12:36.490
I was entrusted by someone

12:36.580 --> 12:37.910
to block your way today.

12:38.100 --> 12:39.130
If you beat me,

12:39.290 --> 12:40.020
you can pass.

12:40.940 --> 12:41.820
If you can't,

12:42.370 --> 12:43.630
get out of Changxiang.

13:49.550 --> 13:50.840
I haven't asked you yet.

13:50.840 --> 13:51.500
Sir.

13:52.580 --> 13:53.910
Who exactly are you?

13:59.620 --> 14:01.080
Did Zhang Qishan send you?

14:01.150 --> 14:01.940
How much is he paying?

14:01.940 --> 14:02.870
I'll pay triple.

14:02.980 --> 14:03.620
Take me to him.

14:03.620 --> 14:05.020
This is just the deposit.

14:06.240 --> 14:07.670
You can't afford

14:08.290 --> 14:09.550
Zhang Qishan's price.

14:09.700 --> 14:10.270
However,

14:11.000 --> 14:12.060
I can go easy on you.

14:13.700 --> 14:15.700
If you can take the wine from my hand,

14:16.100 --> 14:16.960
you win.

14:39.990 --> 14:41.700
You can't beat me like this!

14:42.290 --> 14:43.390
Do you know why?

14:43.500 --> 14:44.760
Because of believing.

14:45.130 --> 14:46.030
Believing

14:46.650 --> 14:48.030
is the biggest trap.

14:50.050 --> 14:51.180
What do you believe?

14:52.240 --> 14:53.790
I believe that I am your dad.

14:55.870 --> 14:56.910
The guy outside—

14:58.050 --> 14:59.250
do you believe in him?

15:01.290 --> 15:03.750
Although he usually
seems a bit unreliable,

15:04.910 --> 15:06.030
I believe in him.

15:07.200 --> 15:08.460
Does he believe in you?

15:12.870 --> 15:14.800
You took such pains to lure me here.

15:14.870 --> 15:17.330
I assume it's not just to play Go
and riddles.

15:18.430 --> 15:20.740
If Great Master Buddha
wanted to drive us out of Changxiang,

15:20.740 --> 15:22.200
why would he let you see me?

15:24.220 --> 15:26.000
What is Great Master Buddha's goal?

15:26.000 --> 15:26.820
And you?

15:27.290 --> 15:28.410
What is your goal?

15:31.480 --> 15:32.980
To ask Great Master Buddha to help us

15:32.980 --> 15:34.030
find Mo Yungao

15:34.060 --> 15:35.460
and rebuild the Archives.

15:35.460 --> 15:37.510
I'm not talking about your apparent goal.

15:37.510 --> 15:38.270
I mean...

15:39.220 --> 15:40.700
your real goal.

15:46.010 --> 15:47.940
You have some special money on you,

15:47.970 --> 15:48.830
and there are

15:48.870 --> 15:50.420
special marks on it.

15:50.860 --> 15:52.990
You drew them when you faked your death

15:53.800 --> 15:55.230
and left it for Zhang Hailou

15:55.230 --> 15:56.900
to investigate, right?

15:57.170 --> 15:58.640
The Nine Clans
really lives up to its reputation.

15:58.640 --> 16:00.300
To deal with someone like you,

16:00.440 --> 16:01.820
I must be very careful

16:01.960 --> 16:03.620
and think through every step.

16:05.230 --> 16:06.580
Why do you say that?

16:09.340 --> 16:10.990
The Hidden Thread strategy

16:12.050 --> 16:14.110
is not something just anyone can use.

16:17.700 --> 16:19.100
Hidden Thread strategy?

16:22.470 --> 16:23.370
Well then,

16:23.590 --> 16:25.230
let me expose you.

16:26.790 --> 16:27.410
Suppose

16:28.170 --> 16:30.390
I want to set a trap for someone.

16:31.660 --> 16:33.710
If I lay everything out

16:33.730 --> 16:34.840
at once,

16:35.320 --> 16:36.650
it actually won't work.

16:37.700 --> 16:40.030
Because the target
will easily become alert

16:40.030 --> 16:41.360
and realize it's a scam.

16:43.390 --> 16:45.480
But if, after setting the trap,

16:45.820 --> 16:46.620
I let them

16:46.620 --> 16:48.580
find a very convincing clue

16:49.510 --> 16:51.350
and gradually

16:51.510 --> 16:53.320
piece it together themselves,

16:53.450 --> 16:53.900
then

16:54.270 --> 16:55.670
they will firmly believe

16:55.730 --> 16:57.890
that everything they figure out

16:58.150 --> 16:59.340
is the truth

16:59.550 --> 17:00.410
and the answer.

17:01.270 --> 17:04.050
Then they will step right into the trap
recklessly.

17:04.050 --> 17:05.609
Because no one doubts

17:05.660 --> 17:07.660
what they have deduced themselves.

17:07.740 --> 17:09.290
But the target won't know

17:09.660 --> 17:11.569
that all his reasoning processes,

17:11.569 --> 17:12.700
and even the ending,

17:13.640 --> 17:15.640
are just part of the trap I designed.

17:16.609 --> 17:18.609
This is the Hidden Thread strategy.

17:19.900 --> 17:21.700
Everyone thought you were dead.

17:22.240 --> 17:23.980
So people would naturally think

17:23.980 --> 17:26.510
the clues you left are correct,

17:27.400 --> 17:28.930
or at least not fabricated.

17:29.660 --> 17:30.610
But actually, they aren't.

17:30.610 --> 17:32.070
This is also a trap you set.

17:32.410 --> 17:33.810
Not only are you not dead,

17:34.090 --> 17:35.010
but you also used this method

17:35.010 --> 17:37.050
to deceive Salty Zhang and Zhang Haiqi.

17:37.050 --> 17:39.300
You pretend to be harmless,

17:39.440 --> 17:42.400
but in reality,
you are the mastermind behind all this.

17:42.400 --> 17:43.050
You...

17:43.830 --> 17:45.620
are Mo Yungao.

17:52.660 --> 17:54.480
[The Pure Charm of Bamboo]

18:13.350 --> 18:15.150
As expected of Ninth Master Xie.

18:15.290 --> 18:17.990
I imagined countless possibilities
for our meeting,

18:17.990 --> 18:19.420
but I never expected you

18:20.070 --> 18:22.610
to give me such an astonishing deduction.

18:23.230 --> 18:25.430
However, it doesn't match the reality.

18:25.960 --> 18:27.180
I know who I am.

18:27.920 --> 18:28.980
I am not Mo Yungao.

18:31.110 --> 18:32.310
If I were,

18:32.310 --> 18:34.870
why wouldn't I hide in the shadows
and control everything?

18:34.870 --> 18:36.110
Why would I take the risk

18:36.110 --> 18:37.310
to fake my own death,

18:37.440 --> 18:38.900
and then come back to life?

18:39.400 --> 18:41.130
Wouldn't that be unnecessary?

18:43.900 --> 18:44.610
Unless

18:45.590 --> 18:46.920
I was already suspected

18:47.570 --> 18:49.770
and needed to use death to clear my name.

18:51.240 --> 18:52.640
But if that were the case,

18:53.270 --> 18:55.400
what reason would I have to resurrect?

18:56.110 --> 18:57.570
Coming back from the dead—

18:58.380 --> 19:00.310
wouldn't it raise more suspicion?

19:02.180 --> 19:04.060
Great risks bring great rewards.

19:04.420 --> 19:06.000
What if by making this move,

19:06.070 --> 19:07.830
you could win the whole game?

19:10.000 --> 19:11.750
Is there really no way in the world

19:11.750 --> 19:14.570
for Mo Yungao
to disguise himself as Zhang Haixia?

19:18.810 --> 19:20.380
What if part of this scheme

19:20.590 --> 19:22.750
is to deceive even yourself?

19:37.110 --> 19:38.230
Mo Yungao.

19:43.980 --> 19:45.600
What on earth are you up to?

19:47.530 --> 19:50.390
A confrontation between people
is like playing Go.

19:50.410 --> 19:51.810
When you meet your match,

19:52.030 --> 19:53.530
you observe their moves.

19:53.840 --> 19:55.850
A person's heart
can be seen through their moves.

19:55.850 --> 19:57.850
Only by understanding your opponent's mind

19:57.850 --> 19:58.940
can you find

19:58.980 --> 20:00.550
a way to counter them

20:01.500 --> 20:02.570
and win the game.

20:17.500 --> 20:18.850
You mean...

20:19.250 --> 20:20.180
The question is,

20:20.680 --> 20:22.480
can you win this game against me?

20:37.380 --> 20:38.000
Young man.

20:38.440 --> 20:39.480
Focus.

20:40.550 --> 20:42.210
If you can't pass this hurdle,

20:42.720 --> 20:43.640
you will

20:44.040 --> 20:46.170
struggle with all the following ones.

21:23.500 --> 21:24.500
Are you giving up?

21:25.810 --> 21:27.070
I'm tired of fighting.

21:27.110 --> 21:28.170
I'm taking a break.

21:31.140 --> 21:33.880
They say Zhang Qishan
is the Defense Commander of Changxiang

21:33.880 --> 21:35.460
and the head of the Old Nine Clans.

21:35.460 --> 21:36.610
You're so skilled.

21:36.640 --> 21:38.240
Are you one of the Nine Clans?

21:43.480 --> 21:44.320
We got to know each other
through fighting.

21:44.320 --> 21:45.320
Let's be friends.

21:45.490 --> 21:46.780
I just want to know

21:47.270 --> 21:49.350
how you can let me pass.

21:50.770 --> 21:51.970
I don't need friends.

21:52.900 --> 21:54.230
And I can't let you pass.

21:56.850 --> 21:58.660
Is Zhang Qishan really that powerful?

21:58.660 --> 22:00.120
Are you that afraid of him?

22:02.230 --> 22:03.350
Entrusted by others,

22:03.350 --> 22:04.810
I cannot break my promise.

22:05.960 --> 22:06.770
How loyal.

22:07.050 --> 22:07.840
Young man,

22:08.070 --> 22:09.800
I have already told you earlier

22:09.880 --> 22:10.880
the way in and out.

22:11.900 --> 22:13.300
But you wouldn't listen.

22:14.030 --> 22:14.960
I asked,

22:16.000 --> 22:17.130
what do you believe?

22:18.680 --> 22:19.770
What do I believe?

22:23.090 --> 22:23.980
Believing

22:24.310 --> 22:25.550
is the biggest trap.

22:26.830 --> 22:28.360
If you believe you are fast,

22:28.830 --> 22:30.560
being fast is the biggest trap.

22:30.830 --> 22:32.630
And you will die from being fast.

22:32.680 --> 22:35.010
If you believe
you are not afraid of death,

22:35.180 --> 22:37.110
fearlessness is the biggest trap.

22:37.720 --> 22:39.400
And you will die from it.

22:40.330 --> 22:40.980
In short,

22:41.500 --> 22:42.770
whatever you believe

22:43.400 --> 22:45.200
is what will defeat you.

22:50.350 --> 22:50.980
Master.

22:53.270 --> 22:54.270
I understand now.

23:00.460 --> 23:01.060
By the way,

23:02.050 --> 23:03.310
what do you believe in?

23:04.030 --> 23:05.200
What do I believe in?

23:07.550 --> 23:10.350
You definitely believe
this wine isn't poisoned.

23:14.150 --> 23:15.370
Didn't you drink it too?

23:15.370 --> 23:16.970
This bottle isn't poisoned.

23:18.100 --> 23:20.030
Don't worry. It's just a laxative.

23:20.420 --> 23:22.620
You'll be fine after you have diarrhea.

23:29.750 --> 23:31.330
Do you think using this little trick

23:31.330 --> 23:32.660
would make me let you pass?

23:32.660 --> 23:34.180
Then do you think,
when I fought you earlier,

23:34.180 --> 23:35.140
I gave it my all?

23:36.420 --> 23:36.960
Let me tell you,

23:36.960 --> 23:38.420
I'm from the Zhang family.

23:38.960 --> 23:40.980
I'm the same kind of person
as Zhang Qishan.

23:40.980 --> 23:42.010
Didn't Zhang Qishan tell you

23:42.010 --> 23:43.470
that I'm his second uncle?

23:43.700 --> 23:44.720
I came to Changxiang this time

23:44.720 --> 23:46.000
to visit relatives.

23:46.110 --> 23:48.640
I didn't expect this junior
to be so ignorant.

23:49.090 --> 23:52.150
It's time to emphasize
the Zhang family's discipline.

23:53.330 --> 23:54.930
I'm going to get serious now.

24:00.090 --> 24:00.650
Come on!

24:30.980 --> 24:31.840
You bluffed me?

24:32.350 --> 24:33.420
You're right.

24:33.800 --> 24:35.530
Believing is the biggest trap.

24:36.140 --> 24:38.770
You believed your absolute strength
was greater than mine,

24:38.770 --> 24:39.440
so when I made

24:39.440 --> 24:41.090
a move beyond your belief,

24:41.200 --> 24:42.310
you exposed a flaw.

24:42.840 --> 24:44.480
Even though it was just for a second,

24:44.480 --> 24:45.810
it was deadly enough.

24:49.960 --> 24:50.720
My mentor

24:51.360 --> 24:53.290
demonstrated this move to me once,

24:54.350 --> 24:55.550
but I didn't learn it.

24:56.920 --> 24:57.900
That's not what I meant.

24:57.900 --> 24:59.830
The idea of believing I mentioned
is actually a philosophy.

24:59.830 --> 25:00.890
I've learned a lot!

25:01.490 --> 25:02.490
I'll be going now!

25:04.530 --> 25:06.010
I'm Heibei of the Nine Clans,

25:06.010 --> 25:07.220
sixth in rank!

25:07.640 --> 25:09.770
Let's have a drink together next time!

25:11.790 --> 25:12.460
Brat.

25:12.460 --> 25:13.990
This drug is really strong.

25:27.680 --> 25:29.110
Shrimpie, you scared me.

25:29.590 --> 25:30.450
So you're here.

25:33.140 --> 25:33.750
Shrimpie?

25:36.030 --> 25:36.630
Shrimpie?

25:44.610 --> 25:45.810
I'm not dead yet.

25:49.440 --> 25:50.420
Unbelievable.

25:51.350 --> 25:53.310
You're in the mood to play Go here?

25:51.580 --> 25:55.450
[The Pure Charm of Bamboo]

25:53.330 --> 25:54.660
I was fighting outside.

25:58.290 --> 26:01.020
I just ran into Ninth Master Xie
of the Nine Clans.

26:01.830 --> 26:03.160
I just ran into

26:03.980 --> 26:04.740
Heibei, sixth in rank.

26:04.740 --> 26:06.400
-So what did he say to you?
-So what did he say to you?

26:06.400 --> 26:07.830
He didn't say anything to me.

26:07.830 --> 26:08.850
We had a fight.

26:08.980 --> 26:10.290
But luckily I learned a move.

26:10.290 --> 26:11.290
So it was worth it.

26:12.220 --> 26:13.240
What about Ninth Master Xie?

26:13.240 --> 26:15.090
Don't tell me
he was playing Go with you here.

26:15.090 --> 26:16.890
It was playing Go on the surface.

26:17.000 --> 26:18.880
He actually wanted to tell me something.

26:18.880 --> 26:19.680
Tell you what?

26:20.330 --> 26:22.130
Mo Yungao might not be Mo Yungao.

26:22.510 --> 26:23.770
I might be Mo Yungao.

26:24.790 --> 26:26.720
Mo Yungao might have replaced me.

26:28.160 --> 26:28.590
Wait.

26:29.500 --> 26:30.270
What?

26:30.670 --> 26:33.270
[The Pure Charm of Bamboo]

26:31.530 --> 26:33.130
Even though I might be Mo Yungao,

26:33.130 --> 26:35.140
we still have to stop him.

26:35.790 --> 26:36.420
Also,

26:37.750 --> 26:40.210
I discovered a possibility
about Mo Yungao.

26:42.980 --> 26:45.780
Have you ever heard of
the Hidden Thread strategy?

27:12.850 --> 27:13.830
So you're saying

27:13.830 --> 27:14.890
all of these things

27:14.920 --> 27:17.780
are a Hidden Thread strategy
designed by Mo Yungao?

27:19.090 --> 27:20.620
Me investigating the case,

27:20.790 --> 27:21.660
destroying the Archives,

27:21.660 --> 27:22.500
and even saving you—

27:22.500 --> 27:24.140
they were all part of his plan?

27:24.140 --> 27:25.800
You are also a part of his trap?

27:27.750 --> 27:30.210
All the information we found out
bit by bit

27:30.920 --> 27:32.980
was likely planned by him in advance,

27:33.180 --> 27:34.740
wanting us to find out.

27:35.790 --> 27:36.460
Perhaps

27:38.070 --> 27:39.310
his plan is to guide us

27:39.310 --> 27:40.610
in one direction,

27:41.300 --> 27:43.360
where the situation is unknown to us.

27:45.050 --> 27:46.140
What is he up to?

27:51.290 --> 27:53.490
So I am reorganizing all the situations

27:54.330 --> 27:56.260
to list out all the possibilities.

27:59.270 --> 28:00.070
Wait a minute.

28:01.760 --> 28:03.150
If you are Mo Yungao,

28:03.850 --> 28:05.220
why are you helping us

28:05.220 --> 28:07.090
analyze Mo Yungao's situation?

28:09.090 --> 28:10.700
I might be Mo Yungao,

28:10.900 --> 28:11.740
but I might not be.

28:11.740 --> 28:13.070
So are you or aren't you?

28:18.290 --> 28:19.090
I don't know.

28:28.250 --> 28:29.580
The key to winning a game

28:30.030 --> 28:31.590
is figuring out the opponent's moves

28:31.590 --> 28:33.320
and seeing through their mind.

28:33.610 --> 28:35.740
But if you can't figure out their mind,

28:36.110 --> 28:37.440
you must question everything

28:37.440 --> 28:38.840
you think is reasonable.

28:40.090 --> 28:42.350
Within those seemingly reasonable things,

28:42.350 --> 28:44.200
there must be hidden clues

28:45.250 --> 28:46.070
regarding

28:46.590 --> 28:48.330
Mo Yungao's true intentions.

28:58.010 --> 28:58.790
I won.

29:04.370 --> 29:08.470
[The Pure Charm of Bamboo]

29:13.870 --> 29:16.000
What on earth does Mo Yungao want to do?

29:51.840 --> 29:54.210
If Ninth Master Xie was teaching me

29:54.790 --> 29:57.380
the Hidden Thread strategy
as if I was Mo Yungao,

29:57.380 --> 29:59.240
then whether I am Mo Yungao or not,

29:59.980 --> 30:01.310
I can use this strategy.

30:03.090 --> 30:04.010
But if Mo Yungao

30:04.010 --> 30:05.220
has already used this strategy,

30:05.220 --> 30:07.280
then everything we knew before

30:08.460 --> 30:10.860
becomes even more unknown and terrifying.

30:15.210 --> 30:16.700
[The Pure Charm of Bamboo]

30:17.900 --> 30:19.960
Let's leave him with no moves to play.

30:21.180 --> 30:23.110
We'll go back to Xiacheng right now

30:23.660 --> 30:25.050
and live our lives happily.

30:25.050 --> 30:25.880
No matter what he does,

30:25.880 --> 30:27.080
let's just ignore it.

30:27.250 --> 30:29.450
Do you think that would drive him crazy?

30:30.810 --> 30:32.570
When will you ever be reliable?

30:34.320 --> 30:35.350
But maybe

30:37.590 --> 30:39.120
it really could drive him crazy.

30:39.120 --> 30:39.730
Right?

30:48.530 --> 30:50.460
Mentor wants us to meet up with her.

30:54.440 --> 30:55.400
Who do you think

30:55.980 --> 30:57.830
is more skilled,
Great Master Buddha or Mentor?

30:57.830 --> 30:58.960
In the Zhang family,

30:59.200 --> 31:01.130
we don't belong to the same system.

31:02.070 --> 31:03.440
If we must compare them,

31:04.530 --> 31:06.860
you can say Mentor is Zhang Qishan's aunt.

31:08.850 --> 31:09.380
Alright.

31:09.980 --> 31:11.710
Then let's go meet this cousin.

31:14.030 --> 31:15.560
But since we're on his turf,

31:16.180 --> 31:18.440
we should at least show him some respect.

31:19.900 --> 31:21.500
What bad idea do you have now?

31:22.770 --> 31:23.300
Let's go.

31:32.980 --> 31:33.890
Great Master Buddha.

31:33.890 --> 31:35.920
Eighth Master
is already at your residence.

31:35.920 --> 31:37.180
Sixth Master and Ninth Master

31:37.180 --> 31:38.420
have engaged them.

31:38.620 --> 31:43.010
[Zhang Qishan,
the First Clan of the Old Nine Clans]

31:40.140 --> 31:41.540
Don't be too optimistic.

31:42.240 --> 31:42.880
They...

31:43.770 --> 31:45.030
are not easy to deal with.

31:45.030 --> 31:45.530
Yes.

31:59.240 --> 32:01.620
Great Master Buddha,
previously, you gave me Changxiang tea.

32:01.620 --> 32:04.140
It goes perfectly
with Xiacheng sweet fruit.

32:04.140 --> 32:05.940
This is a return gift.
Please have a taste.

32:04.360 --> 32:06.110
[Qingjin Fruit]

32:07.300 --> 32:09.030
Mountains and seas do not meet.

32:09.530 --> 32:10.310
Miss Zhang,

32:10.770 --> 32:14.170
you should know the rules
of the Zhang family better than I do.

32:23.530 --> 32:25.330
I'm here to talk about business.

32:25.660 --> 32:27.460
Please do me a favor, Great Master Buddha.

32:27.460 --> 32:28.640
If you get hurt,

32:29.680 --> 32:30.940
that wouldn't be good.

32:32.500 --> 32:33.230
If I get hurt,

32:33.660 --> 32:34.820
it's on me.

33:02.710 --> 33:04.350
Wu, let's go.

33:04.660 --> 33:05.160
Yes.

33:16.200 --> 33:18.010
Miss Zhang, you came from afar.

33:19.290 --> 33:21.590
I'd like to invite you to my residence
for a chat.

33:21.590 --> 33:22.240
Alright.

33:22.550 --> 33:24.150
I will go find my people first

33:24.590 --> 33:25.520
and visit later.

33:30.760 --> 33:34.120
[Zhang Qishan's Residence]

33:40.310 --> 33:42.150
Guard the whole area
within a one-kilometer radius

33:42.150 --> 33:43.200
of Zhang's Residence.

33:43.200 --> 33:43.810
Yes!

33:44.260 --> 33:49.250
[Zhang's Residence]

33:44.390 --> 33:46.180
You two guard the entrance and exit.

33:46.180 --> 33:46.700
Yes!

33:54.980 --> 33:56.180
Listen up, everyone.

33:56.720 --> 33:59.110
Not even a fly
is allowed to enter Zhang's Residence!

33:59.110 --> 33:59.970
Did you hear me?

34:00.180 --> 34:00.790
Yes!

34:07.440 --> 34:08.960
Do not disturb Great Master Buddha
with this matter.

34:08.960 --> 34:09.300
Yes!

34:09.300 --> 34:09.610
Yes!

34:44.030 --> 34:44.670
Catch him!

34:44.840 --> 34:45.610
He is an imposter!

34:45.610 --> 34:46.260
Catch him!

35:03.480 --> 35:04.800
Take me to see my cousin.

35:04.800 --> 35:05.770
It's you?

35:06.130 --> 35:07.150
Or I'll kill you.

35:10.340 --> 35:10.940
Three!

35:13.920 --> 35:14.630
Two!

35:19.280 --> 35:20.390
Zhang Hailou.

35:24.590 --> 35:26.190
Did they give you a hard time?

35:27.420 --> 35:29.590
I have the situation under control.

35:30.090 --> 35:31.420
If anything happens...

35:34.710 --> 35:35.440
Adjutant.

35:35.460 --> 35:36.790
My people have arrived.

35:36.940 --> 35:38.390
Please inform Great Master Buddha

35:38.390 --> 35:40.450
and let us pay our respects together.

35:50.870 --> 35:52.260
Mentor, what did you do?

35:53.550 --> 35:55.010
I gave him a greeting gift.

35:56.920 --> 35:58.180
Where is Zhang Haixia?

35:58.980 --> 35:59.710
In case something happens,

35:59.710 --> 36:00.790
I had him wait outside.

36:00.790 --> 36:01.590
I'll call him.

36:18.500 --> 36:19.480
Where did this brat go?

36:19.480 --> 36:20.140
Never mind.

36:21.260 --> 36:22.780
Let's see Zhang Qishan first

36:22.780 --> 36:23.860
and meet up later.

36:25.730 --> 36:26.280
Mentor.

36:27.360 --> 36:28.560
Zhang Haixia is sick.

36:28.570 --> 36:30.170
After we return to Xiacheng,

36:30.260 --> 36:31.360
can you treat him?

36:32.740 --> 36:33.340
Okay.

36:35.480 --> 36:37.940
You're not hiding anything from me,
are you?

36:38.340 --> 36:39.300
You are so smart.

36:39.300 --> 36:41.300
What could I possibly hide from you?

36:41.630 --> 36:43.550
Stop thinking about Zhang Haixia.

36:43.550 --> 36:44.440
Right now,

36:44.920 --> 36:47.250
we must get Zhang Qishan's support first.

36:51.730 --> 36:53.070
Under the current circumstances,

36:53.070 --> 36:54.530
how do you describe our mindset

36:54.530 --> 36:55.500
in meeting Zhang Qishan?

36:55.500 --> 36:57.310
If we must describe it,

36:57.940 --> 36:59.110
it's like

36:59.420 --> 37:02.400
poor country relatives
visiting to claim ties.

37:04.150 --> 37:05.350
So we are claiming ties?

37:05.350 --> 37:06.010
No.

37:06.230 --> 37:07.000
You are.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.460
Miss Zhang.

37:12.130 --> 37:12.860
You may go in.

37:46.440 --> 37:48.700
When exactly did you come to Changxiang?

37:56.210 --> 37:58.120
That person was no juggler.

38:37.640 --> 38:45.880
[No. 5, Shatong Road]

38:48.260 --> 38:48.880
Who is it?

38:54.060 --> 38:55.450
[No. 5, Shatong Road]

39:01.560 --> 39:05.460
[No. 5, Shatong Road]

39:10.890 --> 39:11.800
Ninth Master.

39:13.010 --> 39:14.380
Great Master Buddha took so much trouble

39:14.380 --> 39:16.110
to get the Nine Clans involved.

39:18.010 --> 39:19.450
Is it actually a test

39:19.470 --> 39:20.930
for us?

39:26.550 --> 39:28.700
It seems
Great Master Buddha wants to see us.

39:28.700 --> 39:30.130
Since he wants to see us,

39:30.680 --> 39:31.920
he will help.

39:32.960 --> 39:34.420
It's just inconvenient for him to do so
because of his status.

39:34.420 --> 39:35.810
You've said it all,

39:36.500 --> 39:38.100
so I have nothing left to say.

39:38.650 --> 39:39.430
Then,

39:40.480 --> 39:42.140
does Great Master Buddha have

39:42.280 --> 39:43.940
further instructions for us?

39:44.360 --> 39:45.190
If he does,

39:45.480 --> 39:46.280
you'll know.

39:51.820 --> 40:00.540
[No. 5, Shatong Road]

39:57.770 --> 39:59.400
Looks like the person Great Master Buddha

39:59.400 --> 40:00.650
told us to wait for is you,

40:00.650 --> 40:01.950
Mr. Zhang Haixia.

40:02.710 --> 40:04.360
We are the suicide warriors
of the Zhang family.

40:04.360 --> 40:05.550
The upcoming mission

40:05.550 --> 40:06.510
is very dangerous.

40:06.510 --> 40:08.190
We might not be able to make it back.

40:08.190 --> 40:09.570
If you want to quit—

40:09.710 --> 40:10.560
Great Master Buddha has said

40:10.560 --> 40:12.150
that he wouldn't force you.

40:14.150 --> 40:15.280
I've made up my mind.

40:16.550 --> 40:17.190
Mr. Zhang.

40:17.780 --> 40:19.180
Great Master Buddha said

40:19.190 --> 40:20.460
you will be in command

40:20.550 --> 40:21.950
of the upcoming mission.

40:22.480 --> 40:24.650
Then we need to set off
as soon as possible.

40:24.650 --> 40:25.710
Where are we going?

40:25.920 --> 40:26.710
The Xiao River.
